      },
      "message": "test(gate): split the as-imported sample's 3D Finish into six level bands\n\nThe heavy test the_sample_as_imported_still_generates_the_3d_finish\n(1804 s in release) moves out of shared_face_bodies.rs into the new\nbinary shared_face_bodies_finish.rs as six band tests. Each band sets\nthe S1 top and bottom heights to one sixth of the model's Z span,\ngenerates S1 alone and verifies it, with the old asserts unchanged.\nThe slowest band takes 267 s; the six run in parallel. A default-suite\ntest pins that the bands tile the span with no gap.\n\nThe 3D Pocket test that PRs 1772 and 1780 change is not touched.\n\nRefs #1715\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus <noreply@anthropic.com>",
